nge: A number of Test Tolerance analyses in TR 38.903 need editorial updates (updates which do not affect the dB values used in test cases). The Test Tolerance analysis files for 38.533 4.4.3.1 are wrongly named. The Test Tolerance analysis.xls for 38.533 4.6.1.1+4.6.1.2+4.6.1.3 +4.6.1.4 has Io missing during T2 The Test Tolerance analysis.xls for 38.533 4.6.2.1+4.6.2.2+4.6.2.5 +4.6.2.6 has conditional fomatting missing on cell F101, and the files are wrongly named. The Test Tolerance analysis.xls for 38.533 6.3.1.4 section b is missing text "UE meas" in cells A54, A55. The Test Tolerance analysis for 38.533 4.6.1.1+4.6.1.6+6.6.1.1-6.6.1.6 TT duplicates other analyses and is no longer needed. Summary of change: Update and correct: Rename the Test Tolerance analysis files for 38.533 4.4.3.1. Add Io during T2 in the Test Tolerance analysis.xls for 38.533 4.6.1.1+4.6.1.2+4.6.1.3+4.6.1.4 Add missing conditional fomatting in the Test Tolerance analysis.xls for 38.533 4.6.2.1+4.6.2.2+4.6.2.5+4.6.2.6 and rename the files Add missing "UE meas" in The Test Tolerance analysis.xls for 38.533 6.3.1.4 section b Remove the Test Tolerance analysis for 38.533 4.6.1.1+4.6.1.6 +6.6.1.1-6.6.1.6 Consequences if not approved: Existing Test Tolerance analyses in TR 38.903 are frequently used as the basis for new analyses. Errors in existing Test Tolerance analyses would be copied into new ones, and may hide requirement violations. Wrongly named files do not list in the expected order and are hard to locate. Clauses affected: Add and remove TR 38.903 zip file attachments as per Summary of change

